<view class="page"><view class="eyebrow">UN AÑO, PASO A PASO</view><view class="title">一年，慢慢走向 B1。</view><view class="subtitle">52 周 + 第 365 天复盘。每周六天练习、一天回顾或休息，按实际掌握情况调整。</view>
<view class="card"><view class="list-title">{{summary.started ? '你的学习计划' : '从今天设一个起点'}}</view><view class="body">{{summary.started ? '开始日期：' + summary.startDate : '先用第一周建立习惯，不用追赶日历。'}}</view><view wx:if="{{summary.started}}" class="body">经过 {{summary.day}} 天 · 建议第 {{summary.weekNumber}} 周 · 周自检已勾选 {{summary.completedWeeks}} / 52</view><button hover-class="button-press" wx:if="{{!summary.started}}" class="primary" bindtap="start">开始一年计划</button><button hover-class="button-press" class="secondary" bindtap="foundation">四步入门 · 已达标 {{foundationPassed}} / 4</button></view>
<button hover-class="button-press" class="secondary" bindtap="month">前四周每日小任务 →</button><view class="note">一年是学习安排，不是等级保证。听说读写需要持续练习与反馈；日历不会自动解锁课程，周自检是你的练习记录。中断后从实际薄弱处继续。</view>
<view wx:for="{{stages}}" wx:key="id" class="card"><view class="list-title">{{item.level || item.id}} · 第 {{item.start}}–{{item.end}} 周</view><view class="body">{{item.focus}}</view><view class="small body">每天建议 {{item.minutes}} 分钟 · {{item.newWords ? '新词建议 ' + item.newWords + ' 个（另加旧词复习）' : '少学新词，优先回顾'}}</view><view class="small body">{{item.output}}</view></view>
<view class="row body"><button hover-class="button-press" class="secondary" disabled="{{selectedWeek === 1}}" data-step="-1" bindtap="move">上一周</button><view class="pill">第 {{selectedWeek}} / 52 周</view><button hover-class="button-press" class="secondary" disabled="{{selectedWeek === 52}}" data-step="1" bindtap="move">下一周</button></view><button hover-class="button-press" class="ghost" bindtap="current">回到建议的本周</button>
<view class="card"><view class="list-title">{{week.level}} · {{week.title}}</view><view class="body">语法重点：{{week.focus}}</view><view class="body">输出目标：{{week.output}}</view><view class="small body">{{week.listening}}</view><view class="small body">新词建议不是当前每日打卡目标；词卡计划仍按你的设置安排到期复习和练习。</view><button hover-class="button-press" class="secondary" bindtap="lesson">{{canStudy ? '进入配套语法' : '查看课程前置要求'}}</button><button hover-class="button-press" class="secondary" bindtap="expression">进入配套表达</button><button hover-class="button-press" class="secondary" bindtap="library">寻找本周学习资料</button></view>
<view class="section-title">这一周，每天怎么练？</view><view wx:for="{{guideDays}}" wx:key="day" class="card"><view class="list-title">第 {{item.day}} 天 · {{item.title}}</view><view wx:for="{{item.steps}}" wx:for-item="step" wx:key="*this" class="body">{{step}}</view><button hover-class="button-press" class="secondary" data-kind="{{item.target.kind}}" data-id="{{item.target.id}}" bindtap="guide">{{item.target.label}} →</button></view>
<view class="section-title">本周自检</view><view class="card"><view class="small">完成后自行勾选，可反选。只记录练习，不自动判断语言能力；未来周只可预览。</view><button hover-class="button-press" wx:for="{{skills}}" wx:key="id" class="secondary" disabled="{{!canCheck}}" data-id="{{item.id}}" bindtap="check">{{item.checked ? '✓' : '○'}} {{item.label}}</button></view><view class="note">{{finalDay}}</view><button hover-class="button-press" class="ghost" bindtap="home">回到今日</button></view>
